          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On August 23, 2012, around 9:15 PM, three individuals observed a dark, rectangular object in the sky above their homes moving slowly from south to north. No noise was heard during the observation, which lasted approximately three minutes. No other witnesses were reported to GEIPAN regarding this phenomenon. According to the detailed investigation detailed in the attached report, the most likely hypothesis is that these individuals saw a kite. The owner and kite have not been located to date. This case is classified as \"B.\"",
